1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:02,210
Try to tickle your own palm.

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:03,330
Right now.

3
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:04,440
Nothing, right?

4
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:06,467
Your brain read the spoiler.

5
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:07,919
Your brain keeps a copy

6
00:00:07,919 --> 00:00:09,400
of every move...

7
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,664
so it knows exactly

8
00:00:10,664 --> 00:00:12,367
where your finger lands.

9
00:00:12,403 --> 00:00:13,763
No surprise?

10
00:00:13,943 --> 00:00:15,567
It turns the feeling down.

11
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,870
But someone ELSE's finger?

12
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:19,180
No warning...

13
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:20,900
and you fall apart.

14
00:00:20,931 --> 00:00:22,380
Scientists had a robot

15
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:24,415
copy your own tickle...

16
00:00:24,415 --> 00:00:26,600
a fifth of a second late.

17
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:28,031
And suddenly...

18
00:00:28,031 --> 00:00:29,408
it TICKLED!

19
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,590
No robot?

20
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,720
...Good luck.

